{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38856","headline":"送李镡游新安 · 杜荀鹤","name":"送李镡游新安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邯郸李镡才峥嵘，酒狂诗逸难干名。\n气直不与儿辈洽，醉来拟共天公争。\n孤店夜烧枯叶坐，乱时秋踏早霜行。\n一间茅屋住不稳，刚出爲人平不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}